nice_touchdown VERSION. Type help for the commands.
Commands:
  new [WxH]        a new game, on a board of W files and H ranks (4x4 to 12x6)
  position TEXT    set up a position, such as OOOO/..../..../XXXX x
  d                show the board
  moves            the legal moves
  M, or move M     make a move, such as a1a2
  undo             take back the last move
  go [depth N]     the engine searches, to N plies or the depth set, and moves
  depth N          the depth of go, 1 to 32
  eval on|off      whether the engine uses its evaluation
  seed N           the seed of the engine's choice among moves as good
  perft N          count the paths of the move tree of depth N
  divide N         perft N, for each legal move
  help             list the commands
  quit             end the program
